# NLP Feature Extraction Patterns

## Preferred Embedding Model
`sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-mpnet-base-v2` — 768-dim, Turkish-capable.
mentor_feedback_text is in Turkish — never use English-only models.

## Always Cache Embeddings
```python
embeddings = get_sentence_embeddings(
    texts,
    cache_path="outputs/artifacts/embeddings_train.pkl"
)
```
Never re-encode the same texts twice in the same session.

## Dimensionality Reduction
Reduce 768-dim embeddings to 48 dims with TruncatedSVD using `fold_svd_reduce()`.
SVD must be fit INSIDE each CV fold on the train split only — never on the full dataset.

## Text Preprocessing
- Fill NaN with empty string `""` before encoding, not `"unknown"`.
- Do not apply traditional NLP preprocessing (stemming, stopwords) to transformer inputs.

## Integration with Tabular Pipeline
Concatenate reduced embedding columns to the main feature DataFrame:
```python
emb_df = embedding_to_dataframe(reduced_embeddings, prefix="emb")
X = pd.concat([X.reset_index(drop=True), emb_df], axis=1)
```
Ensure index alignment between train/test before concatenation.
